--- csdb
format: CSDB
version: 2
name: workout.day-2
schemas:
  - public
tables:
  - public.exercises

--- schema:public
name: public
types: {}

--- table:public:exercises
schema: public
name: exercises
columns:
  name: text
  sets: integer
  reps: text
  date: datetime
required:
  - name
  - sets
  - reps
defaults:
  date: now()
formats:
  date: "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S%:z"
visibility:
  date: hidden

--- data:exercises
name,sets,reps,date
Deadbugs weighted,3,12-15,
BB squats,3,8-10,
Neutral grip lat pulldown,3,8-10,
Cable lateral raise (pulley wrist height),3,12-15,
Reverse cable fly,3,10-12,
Overhead cable tricep extension,3,10-12,
